    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the paws of <i>Hubert</i>, a loyal shepherd navigating the uncharted northern wilderness. In this atmospheric third-person adventure, guide a scattered flock of sheep across gorgeous nature, braving harsh weather, treacherous terrain, and hidden dangers. <i>Hubert</i>\u00a0blends immersive storytelling with a unique herding gameplay experience, all from the perspective of a devoted working dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/9bc266421f0da51396fc6a3e33a4500f.avif?t=1749155759\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A tale of friendship, bravery, and barking at sheep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>Hubert</strong>\u2014fluffy, overconfident dog with a nose for trouble\u2014and his best friend <strong>Lily</strong>, a sharp-witted kid who just convinced the grumpiest farmer in the valley to give them a job. Their mission: herd dozens of mildly chaotic sheep across pastures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well\u2026 not when the sheep have the attention span of a goldfish, the farmer has zero patience, and the nearby forest is lurking with mysterious glowing eyes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc11 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Herding With Heart (and Fur)</strong>: Commander Hubert is leading a battalion of sheeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Story Full of Barks and Blunders</strong>: Navigate farm life, forge unlikely friendships, and try to stay on the farmer\u2019s good side (or at least out of range of his angry voice).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There's something in the woods?</strong>: Something's out there beyond the fence line. Is it squirrels or something more sinister?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Painted Charm</strong>: Explore a whimsical countryside bursting with cozy vibes, oddball surprises, and the occasional howling at the moon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1749155759\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains mild mischief, stubborn sheep, and a dog who thinks he\u2019s the main character (He might be right.)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the paws of <i>Hubert</i>, a loyal shepherd navigating the uncharted northern wilderness. In this atmospheric third-person adventure, guide a scattered flock of sheep across gorgeous nature, braving harsh weather, treacherous terrain, and hidden dangers. <i>Hubert</i>\u00a0blends immersive storytelling with a unique herding gameplay experience, all from the perspective of a devoted working dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/9bc266421f0da51396fc6a3e33a4500f.avif?t=1749155759\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A tale of friendship, bravery, and barking at sheep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>Hubert</strong>\u2014fluffy, overconfident dog with a nose for trouble\u2014and his best friend <strong>Lily</strong>, a sharp-witted kid who just convinced the grumpiest farmer in the valley to give them a job. Their mission: herd dozens of mildly chaotic sheep across pastures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well\u2026 not when the sheep have the attention span of a goldfish, the farmer has zero patience, and the nearby forest is lurking with mysterious glowing eyes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc11 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Herding With Heart (and Fur)</strong>: Commander Hubert is leading a battalion of sheeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Story Full of Barks and Blunders</strong>: Navigate farm life, forge unlikely friendships, and try to stay on the farmer\u2019s good side (or at least out of range of his angry voice).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There's something in the woods?</strong>: Something's out there beyond the fence line. Is it squirrels or something more sinister?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Painted Charm</strong>: Explore a whimsical countryside bursting with cozy vibes, oddball surprises, and the occasional howling at the moon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1749155759\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains mild mischief, stubborn sheep, and a dog who thinks he\u2019s the main character (He might be right.)</p>",
